member.example:
This sample shows how to call GetProductsAsync and parse the result.

ProductApiV1Client client = new ProductApiV1Client();

Response response = await client.GetProductsAsync(null);

JsonElement result = JsonDocument.Parse(response.ContentStream).RootElement;
Console.WriteLine(result.ToString());

This sample shows how to call GetProductsAsync with all parameters and parse the result.

ProductApiV1Client client = new ProductApiV1Client();

Response response = await client.GetProductsAsync(null);

JsonElement result = JsonDocument.Parse(response.ContentStream).RootElement;
Console.WriteLine(result.GetProperty("sku").ToString());
Console.WriteLine(result.GetProperty("name").ToString());

